                                                "sense_id": "93612e1d-8eba-393d-a5c9-1e6142baacdd",
                                                "text": "Didcot had one definite pleasure. We knew that little boys would be going up and down the platform singing out, \"Banbury cakes! Banbury cakes!\" And mother would crane out and buy some, just to encourage the crew."
